              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasohlangothini olusenyakatho izilenge zaziyizingalo eziyikhulu, izinsika zazo zingamashumi amabili, nezinyawo zazo zingamashumi amabili zethusi; izisekelo zezinsika namasongo azo esiliva.",
