        {
          "text": "Ohlangothini olusentshonalanga izilenge zaziyizingalo ezingamashumi ayisihlanu, izinsika zazo zaziyishumi nezinyawo zazo zaziyishumi; izisekelo zezinsika namasongo azo esiliva.",
