        {
          "text": "Izilenge zesango legceke zaziyimisebenzi yokuthungatha, okuyindwangu ebubende neyibubende nebomvu, nelineni elicolekileyo lemicu ephothiweyo; ubude babuyizingalo ezingamashumi amabili, nokuphakama ebubanzini buyizingalo eziyisihlanu, ngokwezilenge zegceke.",
