        {
          "text": "Kanye naye kwakukhona u-Oholiyabe indodana ka-Ahisamagi, owesizwe sakwaDani, engumbazi, nomdwebi, nomfekethisi ngokububende nangokubomvu, nangokubomvu, nangelineni elicolekileyo.",
