        },
        {
          "text": "Lonke igolide elathathelwa umsebenzi kuwo wonke umsebenzi wendlu engcwele, igolide lomnikelo, lalingamatalenta angamashumi amabili nesishiyagalolunye namashekeli angamakhulu ayisikhombisa namashumi amathathu ngokweshekeli lendlu engcwele.",
